ion","metadata","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[80],"dimensions","3D","开发阶段",[84,85,86],"stages","玩法与代码","引擎与场景","测试验证","主题",[90,91,92,93],"tags","Unreal Engine","HTTP","Editor automation","State mutation","延伸阅读",[96],{"_55":97,"_25":98},"HTTP API reference","https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/remote-control-api-http-reference-for-unreal-engine","项目源码",[101],{"_55":99,"_25":61},"用途与特点","Remote Control 是原生引擎接口，不同于社区 MCP 桥接。属性写入可请求编辑器事务及变更通知，但写入被确认不代表包已保存。Epic 的滚动指南将该功能标为 Beta，打包版本和 -game 默认关闭；需启用正确插件、限制网络暴露，并分别确认编辑器与打包运行时权限。","detail","guidance","资源类型","文档","分类","引擎与制作工具","category","lead","summary","name","engines","docs",[124],[90,91,92,93],[121,122,123],[120],"3d","code","scene","test",{"_55":97,"_25":98},{"_126":127},"documents",{"_68":128,"_35":129},[131,135,136,137,134,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,133,170,132,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188],[130,131,132,133,134],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-des